            Cats are small, carnivorous mammals that are often kept as pets.
            They are known for their independence, agility, and playful nature.
        </p>

        <h2 id="benefits">Why Cats Are Great Pets</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>They are clean and groom themselves</li>
            <li>They can be affectionate and loyal</li>
            <li>They help reduce stress and loneliness</li>
            <li>They require less space than many other pets</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 id="facts">Fun Facts About Cats</h2>
        <p>
            A cat can sleep up to 16 hours a day, and their whiskers help them
            sense their surroundings. Each cat has a unique personality.
        </p>

