        <h1 id="about">All About Birds</h1>

        <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/3e/House_sparrow04.jpg" alt="A beautiful bird">

        <p>
            Birds are warm-blooded vertebrates characterized by feathers, beaks, 
            and laying hard-shelled eggs. They are found all over the world and come 
            in thousands of species.
        </p>

        <h2 id="facts">Fun Facts About Birds</h2>
        <ul>
            <li>Birds have hollow bones which help them fly</li>
            <li>Some birds can mimic human speech, like parrots</li>
            <li>Many birds migrate thousands of miles annually</li>
            <li>Birds communicate using songs and calls</li>
        </ul>

